128
00:23:14,830 --> 00:23:16,390
Najveći problem desnice desnica.

129
00:23:16,780 --> 00:23:16,960
Da.

130
00:23:17,230 --> 00:23:17,530
To je.

131
00:23:17,680 --> 00:23:17,920
Da.

132
